 consultar o regulamento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e o regulamento com notas t\u00e9cnicas decorrem online atrav\u00e9s do portal de competi\u00e7\u00f5es da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa (competicoes.aalisboa.com.pt).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":52927,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,624],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[744],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-52926","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lourinha-lisboa","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_3-gratuita-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Cartaz-3o-Milha-Cegonha-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/52926","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=52926"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/52926\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":68391,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/52926\/revisions\/68391"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/52927"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"ht